        <mxCell id="n63" value="1  push full commit SHA and latest" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#ED7100;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#B35900;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF" edge="1" parent="1" source="n5" target="n10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n64" value="4  exact commit: taskdef + appspec" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#ED7100;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#B35900;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n5" target="n12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="350" y="142"/><mxPoint x="800" y="142"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n65" value="2  immutable image push event" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#ED7100;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#B35900;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF" edge="1" parent="1" source="n10" target="n11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n66" value="3  start with commit + digest" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#ED7100;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#B35900;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF" edge="1" parent="1" source="n11" target="n12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n67" value="5  digest-pinned imageDetail.json" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#ED7100;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#B35900;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n10" target="n12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="472" y="212"/><mxPoint x="800" y="212"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n67b" value="artifact store" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#ED7100;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#B35900;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.75;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;endArrow=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n12" target="n14"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="850" y="216"/><mxPoint x="1114" y="216"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n68" value="6  rendered taskdef - create deployment" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#ED7100;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#B35900;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF" edge="1" parent="1" source="n12" target="n13"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n69" value="7  shift listener blue -&gt; green" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#ED7100;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#B35900;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF" edge="1" parent="1" source="n13" target="n25"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n70" value="package nested templates" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#7D8998;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#5A6472;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF" edge="1" parent="1" source="n6" target="n16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n71" value="deployment/*.yaml" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#7D8998;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#5A6472;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF" edge="1" parent="1" source="n6" target="n15"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n72" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;jettySize=auto;orthogonalLoop=1;fontSize=10;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#7D8998;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#5A6472;dashed=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF" edge="1" parent="1" source="n15" target="n16"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n73" value="Security groups - least privilege, one per resource type

alb-sg      in  :80 internet, :9000 test listener
            out :8080 to task-sg only
task-sg     in  :8080 from alb-sg only
            out :443 endpoints + S3 prefix list
            out :5432 proxy-sg, :6379 cache-sg
endpoint-sg in  :443 from task-sg only
proxy-sg    in  :5432 from task-sg only
            out :5432 to db-sg only
db-sg       in  :5432 from proxy-sg ONLY -
            tasks have no route to the instance
cache-sg    in  :6379 from task-sg, and from
            itself for replication

Every group declares egress inline, which removes
the implicit allow-all outbound rule." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#B0B7C3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="264" width="290" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n74" value="Configuration

ECS        Fargate, awsvpc, no public IP
           512 CPU / 1024 MB, container 'app'
Scaling    1 desired, 1 min, 4 max
           target tracking at 60% CPU
Health     ALB GET /health, shallow by design
           grace period 180s, slow start 60s
CodeDeploy BLUE_GREEN, canary 10% for 5 min,
           terminate blue after 5 min,
           auto rollback on failure
RDS        PostgreSQL 17, Multi-AZ, encrypted,
           reachable only through the proxy
Proxy      RequireTLS, idle timeout 1800s,
           credentials from Secrets Manager
Redis      2 nodes, encryption at rest and in
           transit, automatic failover
Logs       /ecs/todo-ecs, 7 day retention" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#B0B7C3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="578" width="290" height="320" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n75" value="Why there is no NAT gateway

Private subnets reach AWS APIs through VPC
endpoints instead: ECR for image pulls, S3 for
the layers behind them, CloudWatch Logs, and
Secrets Manager and SSM Parameter Store so the
task execution role can inject the credentials
and the generated endpoints.

RDS Proxy reads the same secret, but it does so
from AWS-managed compute outside this VPC, so
the data subnets need no endpoint of their own." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#B0B7C3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="912" width="290" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n76" value="Legend" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#B0B7C3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1478" y="990" width="280" height="118" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
